    "chunk_text": "ft, lege dweorgedwostlan gecowene on \u00feone nafolan, sona gestille\u00fe. Eft, diles s\u00e6des lytelne gegnid on w\u00e6ter, sele drincan. Wi\u00fe wambe co\u00f0e & wi\u00fe inneforan sare, \u00feonne for miclum cele wamb sie ungewealden do \u00f0a \u00feing Gif \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feonne sie \u00fe\u00e6s hrifes wendung o\u00f0\u00f0e gesceorf genim \u00fereo croppan laures bleda gegnid & Wi\u00fe \u00feon ilcan genim hlaf geseo\u00f0 on gate meolce, soppige on su\u00feerne. Wi\u00fe wambe co\u00fee seo\u00f0 rudan on ele & \u00feicge on ele. Eft, wilde culfre on ecede & on w\u00e6tre gesoden sele to \u00feicgenne. Wi\u00f0 wambe co\u00f0e, eft, laures leaf ceowe & \u00fe\u00e6t seaw swelge & \u00fea leaf lecge on his nafolan. Eft, heorotes mearh gemylt sele on hatum w\u00e6tre drincan. To wambe gemetlicunge genim betan, adelf & ahrise, ne \u00feweah \u00feu hie ac swa lange seo\u00f0 on cetele Eft, heafdehtes porres gesodenes syndrigne sele \u00feicgean. Eft, \u00fe\u00e6re readan netlan s\u00e6d on hlaf sele \u00feicgean. Eft, byrigbergena seaw selle drincan. Eft, plum bleda ete neahtnestig. Eft, elnes rinde gebeatene, \u00fe\u00e6tte peningge wege, on cealdes w\u00e6tres bollan fullum sele drincan. Be wambe co\u00feum & tacnum on roppe & on sm\u00e6l \u00feearmum, sum cyn bi\u00f0 eac \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan adle on Hwilum hie wel gelyst utgangan & him \u00fea byr\u00feenne fram aweor",
